<%# What the last action did.
    The stay actions redirect with a notice or an alert -- a housekeeping
    request, a check-out request, a refund -- and the
    concierge layout never drew either. A guest sent a request to the hotel and
    landed back on a page that looked exactly as it had a moment before. %>
<%= render GuestUI::Notice.new(message: flash[:notice], variant: :success) %>
<%= render GuestUI::Notice.new(message: flash[:alert], variant: :danger) %>
